      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "VarusQ",
        "name": "Piercing Arrow",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Varus readies and then fires a powerful shot that gains extra range and damage the longer he spends preparing to fire.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Varus draws back his next shot, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> himself by 20%. After 4 seconds, if not fired, Varus will cancel the Ability and refund 50% of its Mana cost.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Varus releases the arrow, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(53.334/100.001/146.667/193.334/240.001 + (80% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, reduced by 15% per enemy hit (minimum 33%). Damage and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> detonation effects are increased by up to 50% based on charge time (maximum <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/150/220/290/360 + ([[si:scalead]]120% bonus Attack Damage))</span>) .",
