      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "VarusW",
        "name": "Blighted Quiver",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Passive: Varus' basic attacks deal bonus magic damage and apply Blight. Varus' other abilities detonate Blight, dealing magic damage based on the target's maximum Health. Active: Varus empowers his next Piercing Arrow.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive: </span>Varus' Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(4/13/22/31/40 + ([[si:scaleap]]25% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalead]]15% bonus Attack Damage)) magic damage</span> and apply a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> stack for 6 seconds (max 3 stacks).<br /><br />Varus' other Abilities detonate <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> stacks dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(3/3.5/4/4.5/5% + ([[si:scaleap]]1.3% per 100 Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> per stack (max <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(9/10.5/12/13.5/15% + (3.9% per 100 Ability Power)) max Health damage</span>). Detonating <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> on champions and epic monsters also reduces his basic Abilities' Cooldowns by 13% of their Maximum per stack.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Varus' next <span>Piercing Arrow</span> deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">6/8/10/12/14% missing Health magic damage</span>, increased up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">9/12/15/18/21% missing Health damage</span> based on charge time.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Passive damage from <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> detonations is capped at 120 damage per stack against jungle monsters.</span>",
