        "summary": "Varus flings out a damaging tendril of corruption that immobilizes the first enemy champion hit and then spreads towards nearby uninfected champions, immobilizing them too on contact.",
        "bodyHtml": "Varus flings out a tendril of corruption, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooting</span> the first champion hit for 2 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooted</span> enemies gain 3 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blight</span> stacks over the duration.<br /><br />The corruption spreads from its target to uninfected enemy champions. If it reaches them, they take the same damage and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Root</span>.",
